{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18690","headline":"植灵寿木 · 柳宗元","name":"植灵寿木","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白华照寒水，怡我适野情。\n前趋问长老，重复欣嘉名。\n蹇连易衰朽，方刚谢经营。\n敢期齿杖赐，聊且移孤茎。\n丛萼中竞秀，分房外舒英。\n柔条乍反植，劲节常对生。\n循翫足忘疲，稍觉步武轻。\n安能事翦伐，持用资徒行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}